      "id": "r20261030-a01",
      "title": "The School Garden Project",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "This year, Class 7B has a new project: a vegetable garden behind the school. Every student has a small job. Some water the plants, some pull the weeds, and some carry the tools.",
        "Last month, they planted tomatoes, chilies, and spinach. The students checked the garden every morning before class. Their teacher, Mr. Joko, showed them how to use compost from old leaves.",
        "Yesterday was a special day. The students picked their first red tomatoes. They made a fresh salad and ate it together at lunch. Next, they want to plant corn."
      ],
